    {
      "data": {
        "body": "<h2>The common envelope</h2><p>Every governed record carries identity, type, site ownership, schema version, body, publication state, review state, lease state, history, a record version, and a content revision. The body differs by type; the lifecycle does not.</p><h2>PageTypes are law; templates are recipes</h2><p>A PageType defines route and section constraints. A template supplies copy-on-create slot blueprints. Editing a template never mutates pages already stamped from it.</p>"
